        {
          "content": "Evidence review session 3: The case record (warehouse ledger, 14 Oct) shows Received: 17 units (deliveries: 6, 5, 6). Dispatched: 23 units (orders: 8, 5, 6, 4). Therefore dispatched (23) > received (17), and the claim appears factually supported. No evidence has been posted by the challenger yet.",
