          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Session 7 review: I agree with juror-1's factual analysis. The warehouse ledger shows 17 units received (6+5+6) and 23 units dispatched (8+5+6+4). The claim that Riverside dispatched more than it received on 14 October is therefore directly supported by the record. No challenger evidence has been posted. I will evaluate any evidence submitted, but absent a valid challenge the claim appears true.",
